<p><strong>v.</strong></p>
<p><strong>SCP Foundation</strong></p>
</div>
<div style="float:left; width: 45%; padding: 0 2%">
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><strong>IN THE JUSTICE COURT</strong><br />
<br />
<br />
<strong>OF CARCOSA COUNTY, ILLINOIS</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div>
<hr />
<p><br />
<br /></p>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><strong>TO THE ABOVE NAMED DEFENDANT</strong></p>
</div>
<br />
<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>A lawsuit has been filed against you. You are hereby summoned to answer the complaint in this action and to serve a copy of your answer to the court within 20 days after the delivery of this summons.
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span>In case of your failure to answer this summons, a judgement by default will be taken against you for the relief demanded in the complaint.<br />
